course: dictionary
lesson: 15056
title: One name, many meanings
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A word with a capital letter at the start is often a name for a person or a place. «Reuben kicked the ball back to his sister.» Reuben is a person's name, so it starts with a capital R.
explain: One word can have more than one meaning. «In the Bible lesson, Reuben tried to save his brother Joseph.» Here Reuben is a person from a very old story, not a boy you can see in the playground.
explain: Context tells you which meaning is right. «Dad ordered a Reuben at the American diner.» A diner is a place where you buy food, so a Reuben here must be something to eat. Ask yourself: what does the sentence show?
fact: «Reuben» is a boy's name, and it is common in the UK and elsewhere.
fact: In the Bible, Reuben was the eldest son of Jacob.
fact: His name was given to one of the twelve tribes of Israel, called the tribe of Reuben.
fact: In the USA, a «Reuben» is a hot sandwich of corned beef, Swiss cheese and sauerkraut on rye bread.
exercise: «Reuben kicked the ball back to his sister.» What kind of word is Reuben here? | *A name for a person | A town | A food | A colour
exercise: In the Bible lesson, «Reuben tried to save Joseph from the other brothers.» Who was Reuben in this story? | A king of Israel | Joseph's father | A sandwich maker | *Joseph's eldest brother
exercise: «Dad ordered a Reuben at the American diner.» What is a Reuben here? | A tribe of Israel | *A hot sandwich | A boy's name | A fizzy drink
test: «Reuben was the eldest son of Jacob.» What does eldest mean? | The youngest | The noisiest | The tallest | *The oldest
test: Why does the word «Reuben» start with a capital letter when it is a name? | *Because names of people start with a capital letter | Because it is at the end of a sentence | Because it is very long | Because it is a food
exam: «A Reuben is a hot sandwich with corned beef, Swiss cheese and sauerkraut.» Which word means the same kind of thing as a Reuben? | A tribe | A name | *A sandwich | A brother
